{"unit_id":"Travizm__dsh-openai-live#card-zh","repo":"Travizm/dsh-openai-live","commit":"6f78ffc2355d24dcf6ed4fac2a77959d2a674d53","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openai-live 为 DeepSeek Harness 提供 GPT-Live-1 全双工语音能力。它通过 realtime 服务接入 OpenAI Live 适配器，并组合语音 agent、会话委派 responder 与 WebSocket 音频传输。用户可以进行实时语音会话，让语音模型把有关 DSH 会话、文件或机器的请求委派给宿主 agent，并将答复转为语音；还可使用录制回放后端进行免密钥验证。适合需要在 DSH 中使用实时语音并调用当前会话能力的场景。实时连接需要 OPENAI_LIVE_API_KEY 和 OpenAI Live 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:33-49","packages/realtime/src/index.ts:12-32","packages/realtime-openai/src/index.ts:48-76","packages/realtime-responder/src/index.ts:332-403"]}
